    "text": "ma5:=ma(c,5);\nma10:=ma(c,10);\nma30:=ma(c,30);\n波动:=(c-llv(l,1)+h-o)/(hhv(h,55)-llv(l,55))*100;\n实体比例:=(c-o)/(h-l+0.001)*100;\n30均线涨:=ma30>ref(ma30,1) and ref(ma30,1)>ref(ma30,2) and ref(ma30,2)>ref(ma30,3);\n均量涨:=ma(v,20)>ma(v,250) and amount/ma(amount,15)<1.1;\ncon1:=ma5>ma10 and ma10>=ma30 and ma5>ma30;\ncon2:=barslast(cross(ma5,ma10));\ncon3:=barslast(cross(ma5,ma30));\ncon4:=barslast(cross(ma10,ma30));\ntj1:=con1 and con2>con3 and con3>con4 and con2<con4+20 and con2<con3+15;\ntj2:=cross(ma10,ma30);\n触发:=tj1 and tj2;\n触发后周期数:=barslast(触发);\nlc:=llv(c,触发后周期数);\nrc:=ref(c,触发后周期数);\n触发后跌幅:=(1-lc/rc)*100;\ncon5:=count(cross(ma30,ma5),触发后周期数);\ncon6:=count(cross(ma30,ma10),触发后周期数);\n触发后:=con5=0 and con6=0 and barslast(触发)>0;\n回踩:=(l<=ma30 or ref(c,1)<ref(ma30,1)) and c>ma30 and 触发后;\n回踩后周期数:=barslast(回踩);\n本次踩后周期:=min(回踩后周期数,触发后周期数);\n触发下穿:=count(cross(ma10,ma5),触发后周期数);\n触发上穿:=count(cross(ma5,ma10),触发后周期数);\n踩后下穿:=count(cross(ma10,ma5),本次踩后周期);\n死叉根数:=barslast(cross(ma10,ma5));\n金叉根数:=barslast(cross(ma5,ma10));\n死叉周期:=IF(死叉根数<金叉根数,死叉根数,0);\n均线连跌:=ref(ma10,1)<ref(ma10,2) and ref(ma5,1)<ref(ma5,2) and ref(ma10,2)<ref(ma10,3) and ref(ma5,2)<ref(ma5,3);\n涨幅分叉:=((c/o>=1.015 and l<ma(c,30) and (ref(ma30,1)>=ref(ma30,2) or (c>ma5 and c>ma10 and o<ma5 and o<ma10))) or  (c/ref(c,1)>=1.04));\n黄金回踩:回踩 and 波动>32 and c>o and 实体比例>=15 and 触发后跌幅<20 and ref(死叉周期,1)<10 and 30均线涨>0;",
